# Google Apps Script web app URL — handles all form submissions (support, dispute, arbitration opt-out).
# Get the URL from: Apps Script > Deploy > Manage Deployments > copy Web app URL.
# WARNING: This value is inlined into the client bundle at build time. Rotate the deployment
# if the endpoint is abused (Apps Script > Deploy > New deployment).
